{
  "id": "E104",
  "title": "If I Had Known",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2017-04-09",
  "synopsis": "Learn an expression you can use whenever something bad happens to you.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/383/b52489bee34693662e337337c1db2496ffcd6c8d.mp3?1491244380",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "早知道\n\n早知道就不来这家饭店了。\n早知道就先给你打个电话了。\n早知道天气这么不好就不出门了。\n早知道会涨价就先不卖那套房子了。\n……\n    生活中，你常常能听到人们说“早知道……”。当人们后悔以前做的决定时就会用这个词。你做过什么后悔的事吗？比如，“早知道汉语这么有意思就早一点开始学了”。",
    "traditional": "早知道\n\n早知道就不來這家飯店了。\n早知道就先給你打個電話了。\n早知道天氣這麼不好就不出門了。\n早知道會漲價就先不賣那套房子了。\n……\n    生活中，你常常能聽到人們說“早知道……”。當人們後悔以前做的決定時就會用這個詞。你做過什麼後悔的事嗎？比如，“早知道漢語這麼有意思就早一點開始學了”。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "If I had known"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "早知道就不来这家饭店了。",
      "traditional": "早知道就不來這家飯店了。",
      "pinyin": "zǎo zhī dao jiù bù lái zhè jiā fàn diàn le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "If I had known, I would not have come to this restaurant."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "早知道就先给你打个电话了。",
      "traditional": "早知道就先給你打個電話了。",
      "pinyin": "zǎo zhī dao jiù xiān gěi nǐ dǎ ge diàn huà le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "If I had known, I would have called you first."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "早知道天气这么不好就不出门了。",
      "traditional": "早知道天氣這麼不好就不出門了。",
      "pinyin": "zǎo zhī dao tiān qì zhè me bù hǎo jiù bù chū mén le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "If I had known the weather was bad, I would not have gone outside."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "早知道会涨价就先不卖那套房子了。",
      "traditional": "早知道會漲價就先不賣那套房子了。",
      "pinyin": "zǎo zhī dao huì zhǎng jià jiù xiān bú mài nà tào fáng zi le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n……\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n……\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "If I had known the price would increase, I would not have sold that house."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "生活中，你常常能听到人们说“早知道……”。",
      "traditional": "生活中，你常常能聽到人們說“早知道……”。",
      "pinyin": "shēng huó zhōng nǐ cháng cháng néng tīng dào rén men shuō zǎo zhī dao",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "当人们后悔以前做的决定时就会用这个词。",
      "traditional": "當人們後悔以前做的決定時就會用這個詞。",
      "pinyin": "dāng rén men hòu huǐ yǐ qián zuò de jué dìng shí jiù huì yòng zhè ge cí",
      "english": "In everyday life, you can often hear people say, “If I had known…”"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "你做过什么后悔的事吗？",
      "traditional": "你做過什麼後悔的事嗎？",
      "pinyin": "nǐ zuò guò shén me hòu huǐ de shì ma",
      "english": "It is used when people regret the choices they made earlier."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "比如，“早知道汉语这么有意思就早一点开始学了”。",
      "traditional": "比如，“早知道漢語這麼有意思就早一點開始學了”。",
      "pinyin": "bǐ rú zǎo zhī dao hàn yǔ zhè me yǒu yì si jiù zǎo yì diǎn kāi shǐ xué le",
      "english": "Have you done anything that you regret?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "For example, “If I had known Chinese was so interesting, I would have started to learn it earlier.”"
    }
  ],
